{"job_id":"F-2bf8b8e7f22df8212023","family_id":"F-2bf8b8e7f22df8212023","title":"법인의 등기사항 등에 관한 특례규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":19,"target_id":"1142df6680a07df3dcb7d30ecf2c4930c78580477eb508c1d171c0aa97ffe6e4","source_hash":"a2cb245111625c80ef0cef37e53f0c92dd8728b6216ebd979075b68621e437fd","text":"关于公司登记事项等的特别规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":106,"target_id":"c5b54da2e94d82f3009eb3fec44164a863c938aa62bc639e2b11acc6bcb19339","source_hash":"9d7c62713ba493bed79251f6ea433acaa9e168c3349abd7aab8a3f43b34c37fa","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是规定为执行《公司登记事项等特殊案件法》（以下简称“本法”）所必需的事项。<2006年3月23日修订；2024年11月29日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":106,"end":272,"target_id":"b1077405e0d4deab56b933fcb81f2289d7e6035ac6e394e8f96569cc8d54b2a3","source_hash":"e93f08386908a62b311e8a4a695b4b2ac1d750b6ab132baee8259df952f20eb8","text":"第二条（海外韩国人及外国人的登记） 在登记公司董事、成员、执行人员或清算人时，如该等董事、成员、执行人员或清算人为海外韩国人或无居留登记号码的外国人，应当登记其外国人登录证号码、国内居留报告号码或出生日期。<2012年4月9日修订；2024年11月29日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":272,"end":372,"target_id":"f4c8420ffdc910079ccc4e873e7084f3303ea1a76dfe94b725d7234a0ea23893","source_hash":"413fbfdb22d3074feeda7873aaa188abb621b8aa05a54bebe033a093c76aa5c5","text":"第三条（关于分支机构或分行的登记事项）本法第三条第一款第二项所称“最高法院规则规定的其他事项”，是指申请表上所列明的分支机构或分行的名称。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":372,"end":393,"target_id":"d687c22f8a23ec3180585f5b592bd46547b9d865708fdc8871873f1a742cbe28","source_hash":"19cbb0c0d624bc67f725ff9d6ec1fcb6d0e7901650991bb4b34e735dc13ee9eb","text":"文章 4 已删除 <2024.11.29>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":393,"end":414,"target_id":"983296afae4a21279f653b460bb3cc9d78830c5813176a2d120c4b9c1857ae92","source_hash":"714a91a8ca5485e9c2a34f62e62468c25414d9202dd563f702161c04f110b5da","text":"第 5 条已删除 <2007.12.31>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":414,"end":435,"target_id":"d9fb5d6d9f098e70681fb78881bcc26b5b392b5c0d6f49177b432cf42d7699e2","source_hash":"a81acde89c692bd6f0dce690d1f289748d0b2c71ccfdbfa8cfa79295abbd349d","text":"第 6 条已删除 <2007.12.31>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":435,"end":459,"target_id":"ef4cf2ae074032d31cba8d8b2ef7cdc5a97e3f019e7a7bc53b442cae97025b52","source_hash":"fb5ba88d40cff14c34b949b1c2f3e6c6aecae12fd7e685fdb09b074e22817627","text":"补充条款 <第1246号，1992年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":459,"end":496,"target_id":"615333cb461ab7a197050d561f1afa6425934ae8905bdb8f3e86bc3bc9f3c5cd","source_hash":"048f9a6bcdafb755d8427c5cfdcd86ee361f97b6e063b23bcc95c919a16fe946","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自1993年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":496,"end":823,"target_id":"a7540f7ada3ec883c08468d31b2a5df5f5bb95a16ca83c3e7b3d0e19c2c9eb87","source_hash":"d9e39a5b62f9dfbfc195d58c3db6514193579b79d2ed83947e20d5b21e5b156b","text":"第二条（分支机构登记表的处理）① 本规则实施时已存在的分支机构登记表（以下简称“旧登记表”）应当于1993年12月31日之前，按照本规则的规定，用分支机构登记表（以下简称“新登记表”）替换。\n\n  ② 第 1 款规定的修改，应当按照本法规定，将分行登记事项中已生效的登记事项移送至新的登记簿。\n\n  ③ 按照第2款规定进行登记转移时，应当按照《公司登记等特殊情况法实施细则》第2条第2款的规定，在两份登记簿上记录登记转移的事实和日期，登记官应当加盖印章；原登记簿应当封存。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":823,"end":955,"target_id":"1f6ed2bd4f995e06d38fd212c7b0f70788522f8c1c65ec0f5d15537d253c47c4","source_hash":"93aebacf288b67ce6e4362de38e17a2eef07b4adf37d5be9091b651148dc67fc","text":"第三条（登记表修改前的过渡措施）凡根据附录第二条规定修改登记表之前，已提出登记申请或申请签发登记成绩单或摘录的，均应按照该条规定将登记转移到新的登记表上，并按照该申请进行处理。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":955,"end":999,"target_id":"869d8faeabce59b2645832c607be533e260ba322ea46b3da976777ce124d647e","source_hash":"621c709ce6fbbf2035661cc921cf37828add72fa1db6bcb1bd368ae7a9aa61ec","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 1595，1999 年 3 月 12 日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":999,"end":1096,"target_id":"d445aed699d99e090fe46505d03441a268e153f7fd9b10b9f20093fa61f3f691","source_hash":"0883b03928391c5e1e19cec59c56eb84b675882cb803523bb8f1bf357466a4b3","text":"补充规定 <2008号，2006年3月23日>\n\n①（生效日期）本规则自2006年4月1日起生效。\n\n②（过渡条款）本规则生效时正在审理的案件，应适用先前的判例。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1096,"end":1149,"target_id":"1563371fd4fac9bd1bb31e5d212edf724c8f8cb8239782b9cc58e95062158435","source_hash":"cd36d396310f5cf59ea0df43b9572b19913c1ffe0004f94e6e79c770f2695b86","text":"补充条款 <第2150号，2007年12月31日>\n\n该规定自2008年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1149,"end":1199,"target_id":"02684ce97b7429d5918971f908c28ef7931da036c0567ea0975ea0c5139227c9","source_hash":"0fd4698d6feedacb35e36e610a5ddc865574cd0ffc7e02ee9e8e0acd2a089f54","text":"补充规定 <第2390号，2012年4月9日>\n\n该规定自2012年4月15日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1199,"end":1223,"target_id":"8fd6e7b439e7afd6cfc5dbb0da5ef676a6e55d7b4e18b29823209a0e807fc3b2","source_hash":"8923d768faff8e94b0db519a516dcb0340dc1d55dba3573fb06804cf76fd1cbe","text":"补充规定 <第3172号，2024年11月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1223,"end":1260,"target_id":"b55ca57de0aa6453e54c5dd3138a2a04b5a70c3962ce710fd720776b79d30314","source_hash":"42cf094160f827371668b2f929b1cbf4d3d8e3b3af046dca7adae82ae1230218","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2025年1月31日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1260,"end":1465,"target_id":"6efea40451bd1ddc478bb1bb81bb6b359728f8efb2396ecfb5bab9b9bd9298a4","source_hash":"46917cd7d4b9745ae565ffb94f7007f24db74903cf5f48ea1e0933468c80f84d","text":"第二条（关于总公司及总部登记记录的关闭等特别规定）  对于因总公司（包括总部；以下简称“总部”）的登记记录在《公司等登记事项特别案件法》第20434号法令（以下简称“修正法令”）实施时关闭、损坏或遗失而需要保存的分支机构（包括各分支机构；以下简称“分支机构”）的登记记录，登记官可依职权主动关闭或保存这些记录。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1465,"end":1657,"target_id":"8a5f612cc63a81962495af1c6fde2f101223ebea6cac05a6a3256e645983de51","source_hash":"2b71eca5dba3d08639070df99106869a239d82cd1680c740ed8fb48c4621632e","text":"第三条（关于分支机构登记记录的过渡措施等）① 为执行修订法附录第三条规定的过渡措施，分支机构代理人、经理等事项移送总行登记记录以及分支机构登记记录注销的登记事务，由司法登记审查员统一办理。\n\n  ② 如果根据第 1 款处理登记事项时出现错误或遗漏，登记官应当依职权予以纠正。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1657,"end":1981,"target_id":"5e77a96cc09382119cda6ba1667c08d301abbabb2f8e1c6e42c68c40d69127b2","source_hash":"e14fb32d1a681f6ad22208c746b9bf45ee675e630a16e3729c3f0e956746aecd","text":"第四条（关于恢复已关闭分支机构登记记录的特别规定）① 清算事务尚存或者有宣告解散无效的判决等情况，公司代表可以向总公司所在地有管辖权的登记机关申请，将修订法实施前已关闭的分支机构登记记录中有关代理人和经理的事项移送至总公司的登记记录。 \n\n  ② 第1款所述情形，已关闭分支机构的登记记录不予恢复，应转移至总行的登记记录。 \n\n  ③ 登记员根据第1款进行转让时，应当在主要办事处登记记录的相关部分记录转让的意图和日期。\n\n删除<2024。 11. 29.>\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1981,"end":2027,"target_id":"af8754026459feeae891be0a5add92747529eda6783e8b0d99729f75a77fb322","source_hash":"7e64aeca12feaef644be1340fff65b06c9b92491daef484bebad0f7aa80ac74c","text":"删除附件1 <2024. 11. 29.>\n\n删除<2024。 11. 29.>\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2027,"end":2073,"target_id":"835a22f4a900468628630c0671f982c274e0dca874ecb93e319dca6c9ed725c7","source_hash":"614264a5c5593db294cc6ce7513335ba0e64d8762ac9a1c6b06dd0ac32d0ea9e","text":"删除附件2 <2024. 11. 29.>\n\n删除<2024。 11. 29.>\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2073,"end":2119,"target_id":"5e9ace07581fd883f4563315fbbba8d12f1b9717740b4a90398b3062f2117e44","source_hash":"9e8c02cbd07e18540fef5a000d508a80ab6c31b2c416d0d72a1e12efa7fcf934","text":"删除附件3 <2024. 11. 29.>\n\n删除<2024。 11. 29.>\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2119,"end":2165,"target_id":"cdc275d9bbba7c6e0c03948d8ea19c17d07fa9833b00d77b112ff4368f640d2a","source_hash":"d31181afc81bcb7f3206d478f2e34ab8b79161352cd4bbb53039a7f0c55655f2","text":"删除附件4 <2024. 11. 29.>\n\n删除<2024。 11. 29.>\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005859-266773-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2165,"end":2400,"target_id":"d22a72214d1afbd4b1c0801ecb49b6fdf60baf61fd005f622df8b76ab1ff74d1","source_hash":"3659120ae363ea149630bfb1cca7623aab9fc516a722e3615c8e04453ce93e5b","text":"删除附件5 <2024. 11. 29.>\n\n删除 <2007.12.31>\n[附录1] 已删除 <2007.12.31>\n\n删除 <2007.12.31>\n[附录2] 已删除 <2007.12.31>\n\n删除 <2007.12.31>\n[附录3] 已删除 <2007.12.31>\n\n删除 <2007.12.31>\n[附录4] 已删除 <2007.12.31>\n\n删除 <2007.12.31>\n[附录5] 已删除 <2007.12.31>"}]}